.* DSPFD, DSPFFD, DSPDBR at a display: the printed form of the
.* description, shown as a spooled file is.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CTLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 78'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=POSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SPLF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PAGELINE CLASS=POSCL.
:VAR NAME=COLUMNS CLASS=POSCL VALUE='1 - 78'.
:VAR NAME=CONTROL CLASS=CTLCL.
:VAR NAME=FIND CLASS=FINDCL.
:VAR NAME=LINE CLASS=LINECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=LINES VARS='LINE'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Repeat find
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SPLF KEYL=KEYS HELP=SPLFH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE BOTSEP=NONE.Display Spooled File
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=44.
:DATAC.File . . . . . :   &SPLF.
:DATAI VAR=CONTROL USAGE=INPUT.Control . . . .
:DATAI VAR=FIND USAGE=INPUT.Find . . . . . .
:DATACOL WIDTH=34.
:DATAC.Page/Line   &PAGELINE.
:DATAC.Columns . . . :   &COLUMNS.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LINES SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=LINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=SPLFH.Display Spooled File - Help
:P.The description as the command prints it. Type T or B in Control to
go to the top or the bottom, +n or -n to move by lines; type text in
Find to go to the next line that holds it, F16 to find it again.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
